MID_EV14_029_m01_038: 
MID_EV14_029_m01_039: 
MID_EV14_029_m01_040: 
MID_EV14_029_m01_041: I don't understand. How does she go on fighting for\nthis mercenary crew of hers?
MID_EV14_029_m01_042: If someone you love dies, just avenge them and be\ndone with it.
MID_EV14_029_m01_043: That's how you see it? For my part, I can understand\nwhere she's coming from.
MID_EV14_029_m01_044: I'm similar to her: I want to live up to everyone's\nexpectations, and I want to keep everyone safe.
MID_EV14_029_m01_045: I envy Jasmine.
MID_EV14_029_m01_046: She has something she wants from the future, and\nshe diligently works toward it without stop.
MID_EV14_029_m01_047: After all, our goals are our guideposts.
MID_EV14_029_m01_048: Tell me, what dream has led you to take part in the\nHeroic Games, Leda?
MID_EV14_029_m01_049: I'm sorry, but I'm going to keep that to myself.\nIt's not something I'm proud of.
MID_EV14_029_m01_050: But what about all of you? I admit I'm dying to\nknow what brought you to the games.
MID_EV14_029_m01_051: Well, for me... I think I'll have to follow your\nlead, Leda, and keep that a secret.
MID_EV14_029_m01_052: My dream is too complicated to explain to strangers.\nSo I won't even try.
MID_EV14_029_m01_053: Well, looks like we all have one excuse or another.\nSo much for a little post-battle bonding.